cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "flakerank: ranking intermittently failing tests by the cost of their intermittency"
abstract: >-
  Ranks intermittently failing tests by expected wasted re-run time rather than
  by flake rate, and reports how far the two rankings disagree as a rank
  statistic with an interval. Research-grade; not flight-qualified, not
  certified and not approved for operational aerospace use.
version: "0.1.0"
date-released: "2026-11-19"
license: Apache-2.0
type: software
authors:
  - name: "OPTIMA Organisation"
keywords:
  - flaky tests
  - intermittent failure
  - test prioritisation
  - continuous integration
  - geometric distribution
  - Kendall tau-b
  - bootstrap
